    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Sequence of Discontinuities (Top to Bottom): Conrad (Crust) -> Mohorovičić (Crust-Mantle) -> Repetti (Mantle) -> Gutenberg (Mantle-Core) -> Lehmann (Core).",
        "The shadow zone of S-waves is larger than that of P-waves because S-waves cannot travel through the liquid outer core.",
        "The asthenosphere (100 km to 400 km) is the upper semi-fluid portion of the mantle that allows tectonic plates to move."
      ],
      "id": "i6mi6vt"
    },
    {
      "id": "n79xzpb",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Important Discontinuities"
    },
    {
      "id": "93fbl6t",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Discontinuity</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Location</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Significance</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Mohorovicic (Moho)</p>",
            "<p>Between crust and mantle</p>",
            "<p>Sharp increase in seismic wave velocity</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Gutenberg</p>",
            "<p>Between mantle and core</p>",
            "<p>Marks boundary of liquid outer core</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Lehmann</p>",
            "<p>Between outer and inner core</p>",
            "<p>Separates liquid and solid core</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "u7e2b4w",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "semegy1",
      "content": "• Earth's radius is approximately 6371 km."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "u9g010i",
      "content": "• Mantle is the thickest layer of Earth."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dynwuu8",
      "content": "• Outer core is liquid while inner core is solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "30jzejf",
      "content": "• Moho discontinuity separates crust and mantle."
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}